sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Script
    participant F as FMC
    participant T as FTD firewalls
    S->>F: POST /api/fmc_platform/v1/auth/generatetoken<br/>Authorization: Basic (user:pass)
    F-->>S: 204 No Content (empty body)<br/>headers: X-auth-access-token,<br/>X-auth-refresh-token, DOMAIN_UUID
    S->>F: GET /api/fmc_config/v1/domain/{DOMAIN_UUID}/object/networks<br/>X-auth-access-token: <token>
    F-->>S: 200 {"items": [...], "paging": {...}}
    S->>F: POST .../object/hosts · POST .../policy/accesspolicies/{id}/accessrules
    F-->>S: 201 Created (saved on FMC only)
    Note over F,T: nothing on the firewalls has changed yet
    S->>F: POST .../deployment/deploymentrequests
    F-->>S: 202 Accepted (task id)
    F->>T: push policy
    Note over S,F: token lives 30 min<br/>POST /api/fmc_platform/v1/auth/refreshtoken with BOTH tokens<br/>max 3 refreshes, then generatetoken again
